      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain is brought into play by a system which detects and transmits messages signaling pain. Opioids negatively modulate nociception, but paradoxically also contribute to hyperalgesia. A nutritional approach with low polyamine contents helps to reduce this phenomenon without the harmful side effects of antihyperalgesic drugs."},
